{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":48,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["頑梗的以色列"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"「雅各家啊，聽我說！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們被稱為以色列人，是猶大的子孫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們憑耶和華的名起誓、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"呼求以色列的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻不真心誠意。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們還自稱為聖城的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"聲稱倚靠名為萬軍之耶和華的以色列的上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"「過去所發生的事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我很久以前就預言過、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"親口宣告過，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然後使它們瞬間發生。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我知道你頑梗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有鐵一般的頸項，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"銅一般的額頭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，在很久以前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"事情還沒有發生時就向你預言，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"免得你說這些是你的偶像做的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是你雕刻和鑄造的偶像命定的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"「你已經聽見了，看看這一切，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難道你還不承認嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"現在我要把新事，把你不知道的隱秘事告訴你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這些事是現在造的，古時沒有，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在今天以前你從未聽過，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"免得你說，『看啊，這些事我早就知道了。』","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你從未聽見過，也不曾知道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的耳朵從未開通。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我知道你生性詭詐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你自出母胎就被稱為悖逆之徒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"「我為了我的名，暫時忍怒；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我為了我的榮耀，壓住怒氣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不消滅你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，我熬煉你，但不像在火爐中煉銀子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我是在苦難的爐中熬煉你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我這樣做是全然為了自己，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我豈能讓自己的名受褻瀆？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必不把自己的榮耀給別人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各啊，我所呼召的以色列啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"聽我說！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我是耶和華，我是首先的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也是末後的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我親手奠立大地的根基，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的右手鋪展諸天。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我一呼喚，它們都侍立一旁。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"「你們一起來聽吧。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"哪個偶像曾預言過這些事？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華所愛的人必成就祂對巴比倫的旨意，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的臂膀必攻擊迦勒底人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"唯有我說過這些事，並且呼召了他。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我領他出來，他必一路亨通。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們到我跟前來聽吧。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我一開始就沒有暗地裡說話，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"事情發生的時候，我就在場。」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"現在主耶和華差來我和祂的靈。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的救贖主——以色列的聖者耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「我是你的上帝耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我教導你，使你受益，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我引導你走當行的路。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"唯願你當時肯聽我的命令！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那樣，你的平安必像滾滾河水，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的公義必如滔滔海浪；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的後裔必多如海沙，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的子孫必像細沙一樣不可勝數，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的名號絕不會從我面前被剷除、被消滅。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"你們要離開巴比倫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"逃離迦勒底人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要高聲歡呼，向普天下傳揚、宣告：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「耶和華救贖了祂的僕人雅各！」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華帶領他們經過沙漠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們沒有口渴。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為了他們，祂使水從磐石中流出，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂使磐石裂開、湧出水來。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：「惡人得不到平安。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/48.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/49.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/47.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":22}